      "content": "300mg caffeine isn't that much for me, i feel fine even with way more than that. so if i'm looking for that peak performance level for my cut, like if i wanted to push it to the absolute edge for maximum fat burning, what's the highest dosage combo that people in the bodybuilding community actually use? just give me a number for the caffeine and the extract that would be the absolute ceiling for a high-tolerance person.",
